1
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,839
You've lived long enough.

2
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:22,519
You'll pay with your life
for what you did to me.

3
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:28,519
Father!

4
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,959
This is the end, Osman.

5
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,479
I'll wipe you off with
your state from the history.

6
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:43,159
Neither this arrow nor
any of you can defeat me.

7
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:47,039
-You'll kneel before me, Osman.
-I won't kneel before you.

8
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:50,679
-I'll only make you kneel.
-Attack!

9
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:29,519
Where are you going, red devil?

10
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:31,999
I wish I could stay, Bala.

11
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:36,279
But I have to live to give
you the worst suffering.

12
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,919
Soldiers, kill!

13
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:54,279
Wait, Poena. Not now.

14
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,399
Don't take this off.

15
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,679
Poena

16
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,639
Osman, Sofia is running away!

17
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:11,679
I shot Osman.

18
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:15,399
Why are we running away,
aunt? We can kill him now.

19
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:19,399
Poena, there are too many
soldiers. I can't risk you.

20
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:22,439
-Aunt, no!
-Poena.

21
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:27,119
We'll take revenge during
their most unprotected moment.

22
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:29,319
They'll definitely find the tunnel.

23
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:32,439
-We should kill them here.
-Don't worry.

24
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:36,999
If they follow us, that
will be a disaster for them.

25
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:41,319
Let's go. Let's go!

26
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:04,239
Bala, there must be a tunnel.

27
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:07,239
They couldn't go out
otherwise. Orhan, you got this.

28
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,599
-Alright, my Bey.
-Let's go.

29
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:35,279
Allah is the greatest!

30
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:52,119
Allah is the greatest!

31
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:05,599
Come on.

32
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,799
You went through this, huh?

33
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:16,519
She left with someone but I couldn't see.

34
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:19,479
They can't go anywhere.
We'll trap them.

35
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,879
Why did we stop, aunt?

36
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:58,159
Someone's following us.

37
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:03,759
But they don't know this is my place.

38
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:11,999
Come on, Poena! The tunnel is going to collapse.

39
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:23,799
The demon ran fast.

40
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,983
She's disappeared.

41
00:07:24,995 --> 00:07:27,879
We'll find him even if
they go deep into hell!

42
00:07:35,640 --> 00:07:38,919
-Why stop? They're running off.
-Stop. I smell something.

43
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:44,799
Run!

44
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:03,239
Alaaddin, come on

45
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:06,039
-I'm coming, brother!
-Brother, let's go!

46
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:10,159
Karesiogullari Beylic

47
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:15,559
I will make life unbearable for you.

48
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,559
I swear.

49
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:23,279
I will make you face fall on the ground!

50
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:27,919
-You'll see. Kanyumaz.
-My Bey.

51
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:32,239
How did Osman get rid of you?

52
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:40,158
My Bey, we didn't attack to
avoid harming Begum Hatun.

53
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:43,318
We thought Osman Bey would kill her, but...

54
00:08:43,520 --> 00:08:45,679
..thanks to Allah he didn't.

55
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:48,159
Well...

56
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:52,639
Did Begum Hatun get rid of Osman herself?

57
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:55,439
She managed to wriggle out of his sword, my Bey.

58
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:57,919
To be honest, she showed great courage.

59
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:01,879
Courage, huh?
Great courage...

60
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:08,959
It's great courage to
wriggle out of Osman's sword.

61
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,959
Beys are waiting in the council, my Bey.

62
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:27,439
Attention!
Karesi Bey!

63
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,519
Peace be upon you.

64
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,759
Peace be upon you, too.

65
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:51,759
Here is my order.

66
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:55,679
My army will be ready
fully-equipped for the war.

67
00:09:56,120 --> 00:10:00,159
As you order my Bey!

68
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:02,759
Words are over now.

69
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:05,719
Blood has been shed.

70
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:10,799
From now on, only swords will speak.

71
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:13,679
We're starting a great war.

72
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:19,239
Before Osman kneels before
me and kisses my flag,

73
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:21,559
..this war won't end!

74
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:24,359
God willing, my Bey!

75
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:31,079
Only I can start and end wars in these lands.

76
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:37,799
For this reason, I'm the one to decide in
which battlefield the fight will take place!

77
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:46,759
My army will be ready
fully-equipped in Yassiova.

78
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:49,759
As you order my Bey!

79
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:57,199
-Are you alright?
-I'm good.

80
00:10:57,560 --> 00:11:00,399
-I'm good, Bala. You?
-I'm fine.

81
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:08,719
-My Bey!
-Mother, are you alright?

82
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,279
Are you alright?

83
00:11:10,280 --> 00:11:13,239
-We're fine.
We're good. Don't worry.

84
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:16,079
This place is going to collapse. Out!

85
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:17,799
Come on, come on

86
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:03,999
They laid a trap there in advance, my Bey.

87
00:12:04,880 --> 00:12:06,399
The dog called Sofia...

88
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:08,399
Her mind works like the devil's.

89
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:10,879
She always has another plan.

90
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:15,119
My Bey.

91
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:17,599
Your bleeding is going worse.

92
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,919
-I should cauterize the wound.
-No.

93
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:21,919
This wound can't harm my Bey.

94
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:24,759
It's just a badge in his chest.

95
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,919
I'm good. Don't worry.

96
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:30,479
We killed all the heathens
in the temple, my Bey.

97
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:34,039
But the dastard called Lukas ran away.

98
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:37,199
Hearing the explosion, we rushed here.

99
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:41,319
He is living his last moments.

100
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:43,959
I'll cut off his head soon.

101
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:46,519
We're going to the tribe.

102
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:51,479
Until both Sofia and Lukas lose their heads

103
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:55,559
...we won't even sleep! Let's go.

104
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:13,319
Karesi Bey sped up his war preparations.

105
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:16,879
But I found out the location
of their headquarters.

106
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:24,649
Deliver this to Osman Bey
without being seen by anyone.

107
00:13:24,649 --> 00:13:26,139
As you order, my lady.

108
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:40,999
Karesi Bey was right to be suspicious.

109
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:43,359
You are Osman Bey's spy, huh?

110
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:47,359
Let my spilled blood be a witness.

111
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:53,279
Osman and his children all of them...

112
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:55,359
..all of them Sofia..

113
00:13:55,880 --> 00:14:00,959
I will not die until all of them are dead.

114
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:04,199
I swear to you I will not die.

115
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:07,999
This is the last wound
Osman inflicted on us, Lukas.

116
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:10,839
It will not happen again.

117
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:27,519
I was so close.

118
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:31,759
I was going to kill Osman and Bala.

119
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:38,279
Why, aunt?

120
00:14:38,680 --> 00:14:40,439
Why?
Poena.

121
00:14:42,520 --> 00:14:43,639
Poena.

122
00:14:46,880 --> 00:14:48,319
My little bird.

123
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,359
What did I say?

124
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:55,799
For you, for your life.

125
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:08,639
-They didn't see your face, right?
-They didn't.

126
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:12,359
I shot Osman aunt.

127
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:17,999
If I could shoot one more
arrow, he would have died.

128
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:19,639
Come here.

129
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:26,159
You will do it.

130
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,679
You will do it.

131
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:34,079
You will get much closer to them and kill them.

132
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:43,479
The time has come.

133
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:48,759
Our game begins.

134
00:15:56,920 --> 00:16:02,439
Welcome our Bey! Welcome!

135
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:15,559
My Bey.

136
00:16:15,560 --> 00:16:18,239
Osman Bey, you are wounded.

137
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:19,919
Does your wound hurt much?

138
00:16:19,920 --> 00:16:21,759
I'm alright, don't worry.

139
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:26,319
Ayse, why are you asking if his
wound hurts in front of people?

140
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:28,679
He is the leader of a state!

141
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:31,879
Even if it hurts, he doesn't let them see it!

142
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:39,399
How do you know this?

143
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:41,999
I know, Osman Bey, I know.

144
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:45,519
Today, the decision of a leader
won, not the schemes of infidels!

145
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:50,159
Look at you, who teaches you this? Cerkutay?

146
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:55,399
Those who spend time with
wolves learn how to howl my Bey.

147
00:16:58,560 --> 00:16:59,599
My Bey.

148
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,119
Is there any news from the...

149
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:03,799
..Sofia or Lukas infidels?

150
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:09,919
We destroyed Sofia's nest and her soldiers.

151
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:12,439
For now, she escaped.

152
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:16,999
But Sofia and Lukas will
be erased from these lands.

153
00:17:17,400 --> 00:17:22,637
And Karesi Bey, her collaborator, will
also pay for what he did. Don't worry!

154
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:23,959
God willing.

155
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:27,999
Come on.

156
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:32,959
-Let's start the council.
-As you order, my Bey.

157
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,919
Can I come in my Bey?

158
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:43,039
Come in.

159
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:56,159
You were right to be suspicious, my Bey.

160
00:17:56,400 --> 00:18:00,079
Begum Hatun sent a letter to
Osman Bey through her helper.

161
00:18:07,080 --> 00:18:12,519
So, you have been betraying
us all along, Begum Hatun?

162
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:18,839
If I am Karesi Bey, I will
not let you get away with this.

163
00:18:26,280 --> 00:18:30,599
Shall we kill Begum Hatun's helper
before she takes the letter to him, my Bey?

164
00:18:31,040 --> 00:18:32,559
No.

165
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:39,919
We will not harm either
the helper or Begum Hatun.

166
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:43,679
They will think I don't know.

167
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:49,439
Through Begum, I will set
such a trap for Osman that...

168
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:02,319
How did you do this to her?

169
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:06,857
I told you not to
underestimate me, Lukas.

170
00:19:06,869 --> 00:19:08,199
Yes...

171
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:09,599
But how?

172
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:13,997
When you kidnapped her, she was old
enough to remember her family, wasn't she?

173
00:19:14,009 --> 00:19:15,359
She was a child.

174
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:18,359
Children love fairy tales the most.

175
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:22,959
Fairy tales are full of lies.

176
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:31,999
Master Yannis's student Martin prepared
a potion to make her forget everything.

177
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:35,839
Father, where are you?

178
00:19:43,620 --> 00:19:45,299
Poena.

179
00:19:45,640 --> 00:19:47,119
Are you awake?

180
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:49,479
My name is Halime.

181
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:56,839
Your name is Poena.

182
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:03,719
Are you hungry?

183
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,919
I brought you milk.

184
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:22,439
Poena..

185
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:31,119
Look, if you drink this...

186
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:34,119
...your father will come.

187
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:38,239
Will you drink this?

188
00:20:40,600 --> 00:20:42,119
Well done, my daughter.

189
00:20:42,120 --> 00:20:44,839
Good girl.

190
00:20:44,840 --> 00:20:47,799
Well done.

191
00:20:47,800 --> 00:20:51,679
Almost done.

192
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:58,479
Soon, you won't remember a thing.

193
00:20:58,480 --> 00:21:00,159
Your pain will go away.

194
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:03,999
Well done.

195
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:10,119
My little bird.

196
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:11,799
Are you sure?

197
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:16,239
Are you sure she forgot
everything? What if she remembers?

198
00:21:16,240 --> 00:21:18,559
That will never happen, Lukas!

199
00:21:18,560 --> 00:21:20,639
Poena is tied to me not by blood...

200
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:25,159
...but by something stronger.

201
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:34,359
-Love.
-Love?

202
00:21:36,280 --> 00:21:38,439
You and love?

203
00:21:39,040 --> 00:21:41,239
Me and love.

204
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:44,919
Then what will you do, Sofia?

205
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:47,319
What will you do when everything is over?

206
00:21:47,320 --> 00:21:50,519
Won't you kill her?

207
00:21:50,520 --> 00:21:53,279
Osman took my future, Lukas.

208
00:21:53,280 --> 00:21:59,239
He destroyed Master Yannis'
lineage. But with Poena...

209
00:22:00,840 --> 00:22:04,519
..I will continue Master Yannis' teachings.

210
00:22:16,360 --> 00:22:18,119
The swords are drawn.

211
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:23,079
We are at war with Karesi.

212
00:22:24,800 --> 00:22:27,199
This will be a battlefield war

213
00:22:27,800 --> 00:22:30,919
But Karesi cannot be trusted.

214
00:22:31,040 --> 00:22:36,159
For his interests, he might
attack us from other places.

215
00:22:38,680 --> 00:22:42,799
That's why we will be more cautious...

216
00:22:42,960 --> 00:22:47,159
...in all our cities, tribes, and castles...

217
00:22:47,400 --> 00:22:50,079
...where our flag flies...

218
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:52,759
...together with our people and soldiers.

219
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:55,719
Prepare everything.
-As you order, my Bey.

220
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:59,559
-As you order my Bey.
-As you order my Bey. -After the sun rises...

221
00:23:01,120 --> 00:23:04,639
...we will fight against Karesi.
-Yes my Bey.

222
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:08,479
If he faces us, that will be good.

223
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:11,719
If not...

224
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:16,119
...we will attack each of his properties.

225
00:23:20,560 --> 00:23:22,159
Can I come in, my Bey?

226
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:26,199
Come in, Yagiz.

227
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:30,959
My Bey, Yusuf Bey.

228
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:33,839
He is asking for your
permission to come in, my Bey.

229
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:35,079
Let him in.

230
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:41,399
My Bey, there is news
from my sister Begum Hatun.

231
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:44,359
-She sent her helper to the tribe.
-What did she say?

232
00:23:44,360 --> 00:23:48,839
At the council, Karesi Bey said,
"If Osman Bey wants a battlefield...

233
00:23:50,410 --> 00:23:53,129
...I will decide which
field it will take place."

234
00:23:53,520 --> 00:23:56,759
He has placed his quarters near Yassova, my Bey.

235
00:23:57,280 --> 00:23:58,799
Is that so?

236
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:06,439
So he accepts the battlefield.

237
00:24:08,760 --> 00:24:10,039
Bayhan Bey...

238
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:15,839
Tomorrow, you will place
our quarters near Yassova.

239
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:20,879
Until the army arrives, the
headquarter's safety is in your hands.

240
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:23,319
I will do everything I can, Osman Bey.

241
00:24:23,360 --> 00:24:25,119
As you say.

242
00:24:30,320 --> 00:24:31,719
Tomorrow..

243
00:24:33,120 --> 00:24:35,959
...the fate of these lands will be decided.

244
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:39,439
This war..

245
00:24:41,040 --> 00:24:45,319
This will be a war between those
who walk with The Righteous' guidance...

246
00:24:45,320 --> 00:24:47,839
...and those who stray from the right path.

247
00:25:06,600 --> 00:25:11,239
Finally, you have found
the right path, Begum Hatun.

248
00:25:12,320 --> 00:25:15,399
Thanks to those who showed me the right way.

249
00:25:18,160 --> 00:25:19,639
You know..

250
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:23,639
Begum Hatun not only entered my council...

251
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:28,479
-She will soon become my wife.
-I know.

252
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:31,879
I know, Karesi Bey. Good.

253
00:25:32,840 --> 00:25:35,519
Then let me give you my wedding gift.

254
00:25:35,840 --> 00:25:40,999
In the war you will fight, I will
be behind you with all my power.

255
00:25:45,200 --> 00:25:49,199
My power is enough to destroy Osman.

256
00:25:50,120 --> 00:25:55,319
But I will also give you the
opportunity to take revenge.

257
00:25:57,280 --> 00:26:00,879
I am eager to hear your war plans, Karesi Bey.

258
00:26:02,120 --> 00:26:04,119
Come, Lukas.

259
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:23,833
I have set up such a
plan that I will attack

260
00:26:23,845 --> 00:26:26,879
Osman before he even
arrives on the battlefield.

261
00:26:30,880 --> 00:26:31,719
How?

262
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:39,839
Osman will set up his headquarters near Yassova.

263
00:26:39,840 --> 00:26:44,359
I will attack him with catapults from a hill.

264
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:51,399
I will destroy his Alps and supplies
before they even reach the battlefield.

265
00:26:52,160 --> 00:26:59,079
So, on the day of the war,
Osman will be weak and helpless.

266
00:27:00,560 --> 00:27:02,799
That's smart.

267
00:27:03,880 --> 00:27:08,479
Osman will pay the price
for competing with you...

268
00:27:08,560 --> 00:27:09,959
...Karesi Bey.

269
00:27:16,280 --> 00:27:17,879
Begum Hatun.

270
00:27:18,640 --> 00:27:20,639
You seem tired.

271
00:27:21,120 --> 00:27:24,319
You can rest a bit if you like.

272
00:27:24,520 --> 00:27:27,119
I haven't slept well in the past few nights.

273
00:27:28,080 --> 00:27:30,959
I think I better rest. Excuse me.

274
00:27:30,960 --> 00:27:32,639
Sure.

275
00:27:38,920 --> 00:27:41,479
Go, you spy.

276
00:27:41,960 --> 00:27:45,519
Go and deliver the news to Osman.

277
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:49,239
What are you saying, Karesi Bey?

278
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:55,559
Is Begum Hatun a traitor?

279
00:28:00,400 --> 00:28:03,239
Then this is all a game.

280
00:28:03,520 --> 00:28:05,279
There will be no attack.

281
00:28:05,280 --> 00:28:08,299
There will be.
There will be.

282
00:28:08,560 --> 00:28:11,399
But it's you who'll perform.

283
00:28:11,800 --> 00:28:14,879
Osman will think I will attack.

284
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:19,359
But I will only waste his time.

285
00:28:19,520 --> 00:28:21,519
The one attacking the headquarters...

286
00:28:23,200 --> 00:28:25,439
..will be you, Lukas.

287
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:53,839
Do you like wearing those ugly clothes?

288
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,119
No.

289
00:28:57,040 --> 00:28:58,439
Just..

290
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:03,079
I just feel like I'm someone
else in these clothes, aunt.

291
00:29:19,840 --> 00:29:22,319
To make sure you don't forget yourself.

292
00:29:27,440 --> 00:29:28,879
My little bird.

293
00:29:36,760 --> 00:29:38,559
It belonged to your mother...

294
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:40,599
Nevadoka.

295
00:29:49,720 --> 00:29:51,319
My little...

296
00:29:55,120 --> 00:29:58,199
...my little revenge angel.

297
00:30:00,600 --> 00:30:02,639
The big day has come.

298
00:30:05,560 --> 00:30:11,039
Tomorrow, you will convince
Fatma and enter the Kayi Tribe.

299
00:30:11,440 --> 00:30:15,239
And you will kill your mother's murderer, Bala.

300
00:30:15,680 --> 00:30:16,839
I will kill her.

301
00:30:20,240 --> 00:30:21,279
But...

302
00:30:22,640 --> 00:30:25,559
...what if Osman doesn't die in the war?

303
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:27,999
What if he returns to the tribe?

304
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:30,239
Osman.

305
00:30:31,040 --> 00:30:35,119
If Osman returns to the
tribe and sees Bala dead...

306
00:30:36,400 --> 00:30:39,479
...half of his life will be gone anyway.

307
00:30:40,280 --> 00:30:42,279
And you will take..

308
00:30:44,720 --> 00:30:46,559
..the other half.

309
00:30:51,600 --> 00:30:55,839
So, they love each other
enough to die for one another.

310
00:31:00,280 --> 00:31:03,279
You will destroy that family.

311
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:07,999
As they destroyed your family.

312
00:31:09,760 --> 00:31:16,199
You will take your mother's
and father's revenge.

313
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:26,199
Bala, were you able to see the face of
the person Sofia took with her? Who was it?

314
00:31:26,720 --> 00:31:27,919
No my Bey.

315
00:31:27,920 --> 00:31:30,639
We don't know who is important for Sofia.

316
00:31:30,800 --> 00:31:32,959
So there is someone she cares.

317
00:31:33,080 --> 00:31:36,319
You are talking about Sofia. She is the devil.

318
00:31:36,360 --> 00:31:39,199
There's no goodwill or compassion in her.

319
00:31:40,800 --> 00:31:46,639
Whoever she took must
definitely be someone useful to her.

320
00:31:47,440 --> 00:31:52,039
When we cornered her, I tried to
make her talk, but she didn't say anything.

321
00:31:54,320 --> 00:31:56,519
Even that might be a game, huh?

322
00:31:58,480 --> 00:32:02,359
-She must have something evil in her mind.
-You're right.

323
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:05,759
Now they will unite with Karesi.

324
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:12,799
Yes, they will...

325
00:32:14,040 --> 00:32:15,639
But Karesi Bey..

326
00:32:16,440 --> 00:32:19,279
We had to get into this war because of him.

327
00:32:20,280 --> 00:32:23,799
So much blood will be shed because of his greed.

328
00:32:23,800 --> 00:32:26,719
If they unite, they will
become too strong, Osman.

329
00:32:26,720 --> 00:32:28,999
How will we get out of that circle of fire?

330
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:31,359
No matter how strong they become...

331
00:32:31,360 --> 00:32:33,599
...we will destroy that evil alliance.

332
00:32:34,120 --> 00:32:35,559
Let's pray that..

333
00:32:35,960 --> 00:32:38,039
...Begum Hatun does not get exposed.

334
00:32:40,320 --> 00:32:43,679
The days have come when
we even pray for Begum Hatun.

335
00:32:44,600 --> 00:32:47,839
Let her fulfill her duty
properly, that's all we need.

336
00:33:14,240 --> 00:33:17,079
Are the weapons ready? What's the situation?

337
00:33:17,080 --> 00:33:18,839
Smiths are working, my Bey.

338
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:20,879
Good.

339
00:33:21,320 --> 00:33:26,839
All the preparations should be finished by
the time our army reaches the headquarters.

340
00:33:27,120 --> 00:33:28,839
As you order, my Bey.

341
00:33:32,960 --> 00:33:36,279
What's the matter? Just spill the beans.

342
00:33:36,600 --> 00:33:38,879
Nothing, my Bey.

343
00:33:41,080 --> 00:33:45,439
I'm thinking about the times when
I dreamed of fighting beside you.

344
00:33:46,480 --> 00:33:48,719
My childhood...

345
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:54,039
Whenever we fight together
now, that child feels happy, father.

346
00:33:54,680 --> 00:33:57,479
May Allah be pleased with you.
-My brave son.

347
00:33:57,680 --> 00:34:01,719
Thank Allah for letting us see these days.

348
00:34:04,160 --> 00:34:07,319
I know that the tribe
won't stay without a head...

349
00:34:08,440 --> 00:34:10,399
...if my life ends today.

350
00:34:13,040 --> 00:34:16,518
What do you mean, father?
May Allah give you a long life.

351
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:22,159
Well... I know my brave
son will protect my heritage.

352
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:27,599
That's why no battles can intimidate Bayhan Bey.

353
00:34:31,040 --> 00:34:33,399
Attention! Osman Bey!

354
00:34:46,719 --> 00:34:50,478
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you, too, my Bey.

355
00:34:53,199 --> 00:34:55,879
Bayhan Bey, what is the situation?

356
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:58,679
All the preparations done in the headquarter?

357
00:34:58,760 --> 00:35:03,159
Defense pits, patrols and food silos...

358
00:35:03,480 --> 00:35:07,159
We took all the measures as you ordered, my Bey.

359
00:35:09,570 --> 00:35:12,669
Did you increase the numbers of
the scouts around the tribe, Gonca?

360
00:35:12,669 --> 00:35:15,239
Everybody is on alert as you warned, mother.

361
00:35:15,320 --> 00:35:18,519
Good. Ulgen!

362
00:35:19,080 --> 00:35:22,399
You checked the food to
go to the headquarter, right?

363
00:35:22,400 --> 00:35:25,119
I prepared more than enough, Bala. Don't worry.

364
00:35:25,240 --> 00:35:27,519
Good, good. Alps!

365
00:35:27,840 --> 00:35:29,159
Be cautious.

366
00:35:29,280 --> 00:35:31,479
Take it to the headquarter in no time.

367
00:35:31,520 --> 00:35:33,279
As you order, Bala Hatun.

368
00:35:42,480 --> 00:35:44,399
Come on, come on.

369
00:35:51,440 --> 00:35:54,119
While our army is preparing for the war,

370
00:35:54,680 --> 00:35:57,319
...we will continue trading.

371
00:35:57,760 --> 00:36:01,159
So we will keep inspecting the stalls, hatuns.

372
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:03,599
We have much to do.

373
00:36:15,280 --> 00:36:16,999
Hatuns.

374
00:36:19,440 --> 00:36:21,199
Is there a problem?

375
00:36:22,080 --> 00:36:24,639
Just name it. And we will solve it.

376
00:36:26,160 --> 00:36:29,399
Isn't Gonca Hatun here?

377
00:36:33,080 --> 00:36:34,959
Gonca Hatun..

378
00:36:35,880 --> 00:36:38,079
...is on another duty.

379
00:36:38,360 --> 00:36:40,039
I'm here now.

380
00:36:45,240 --> 00:36:49,639
Holofira Hatun, wife of Orhan Bey!

381
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:56,519
I'm in charge here as a Kayi hatun.

382
00:36:58,880 --> 00:37:01,239
And this is the last time I say this.

383
00:37:01,440 --> 00:37:06,719
While our soldiers and
alps risk their lives for us

384
00:37:07,120 --> 00:37:10,999
...you will perform your duties...

385
00:37:12,320 --> 00:37:15,279
...instead of asking impertinent questions!

386
00:37:17,120 --> 00:37:21,879
Otherwise I will forgive no mistakes!

387
00:37:26,040 --> 00:37:27,799
Now..

388
00:37:29,040 --> 00:37:31,359
Get back to your work!

389
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:37,959
Praise be to my sister-in-law.

390
00:37:38,400 --> 00:37:40,639
All of them will come around...

391
00:37:40,880 --> 00:37:42,959
...and accept you.

392
00:37:43,520 --> 00:37:46,319
I won't let any other ways, Fatma.

393
00:38:03,160 --> 00:38:06,839
Meryem, are you alright? What's wrong?

394
00:38:07,880 --> 00:38:11,599
My grandmother... She has died, Fatma Hatun.

395
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:14,079
I have nobody else.

396
00:38:14,320 --> 00:38:16,159
I don't know what to do.

397
00:38:16,640 --> 00:38:18,319
I'm so sorry.

398
00:38:18,720 --> 00:38:20,399
My condolences.

399
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:23,279
But don't be too hard on yourself.

400
00:38:23,600 --> 00:38:26,199
Allah gives lives and takes lives.

401
00:38:26,440 --> 00:38:29,639
I have no money and no food.

402
00:38:30,040 --> 00:38:31,959
I have nowhere to go.

403
00:38:33,040 --> 00:38:34,559
I know...

404
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:36,919
You train Sisters.

405
00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:39,599
Won't you let me join?

406
00:38:42,320 --> 00:38:45,999
-Can you use a sword?
-I can if you teach me.

407
00:38:46,520 --> 00:38:49,879
Even if I can't, I can cook for Sisters.

408
00:38:50,480 --> 00:38:52,119
And wash their clothes.

409
00:38:52,400 --> 00:38:55,159
Please don't leave me alone, Fatma Hatun.

410
00:38:55,480 --> 00:38:59,239
Nobody will be alone in
Osman Bey's land, Meryem.

411
00:38:59,720 --> 00:39:02,119
May Allah be pleased with you, Fatma Hatun.

412
00:39:11,200 --> 00:39:14,479
Come on, let me introduce you to Sisters.

413
00:39:17,800 --> 00:39:20,799
Karesiogullari Beylic

414
00:39:31,080 --> 00:39:34,119
You wanted to see me, Karesi Bey?

415
00:39:35,520 --> 00:39:38,399
Where are we going?

416
00:39:38,920 --> 00:39:44,479
We're going to watch Osman's
quarters be destroyed, Begum Hatun.

417
00:39:48,040 --> 00:39:49,239
What?

418
00:39:49,400 --> 00:39:52,079
Are you unhappy for this?

419
00:39:52,880 --> 00:39:54,399
Just the opposite.

420
00:39:55,080 --> 00:39:59,879
My biggest dream is to see
Osman's being defeated, Karesi Bey.

421
00:40:02,320 --> 00:40:04,679
Let's not be late then.

422
00:40:06,200 --> 00:40:10,559
-Kanyumaz, alps?
-They're waiting for us on the hill, my Bey.

423
00:40:11,840 --> 00:40:13,959
Come on then.

424
00:40:14,640 --> 00:40:16,479
We should go.

425
00:40:17,040 --> 00:40:19,359
Victory is waiting for us.

426
00:40:19,680 --> 00:40:22,159
Tell experienced watchmen...

427
00:40:22,400 --> 00:40:24,839
...not only to watch around our quarters...

428
00:40:25,200 --> 00:40:29,199
...but also watch beyond
Karesi Bey's headquarters.

429
00:40:29,440 --> 00:40:31,759
We should know whatever moves.

430
00:40:32,000 --> 00:40:33,719
As you order, my Bey.

431
00:40:36,240 --> 00:40:38,239
Aykurt Cavus.

432
00:40:39,880 --> 00:40:41,319
My Bey.

433
00:40:42,080 --> 00:40:44,199
We got a message from Begum Hatun.

434
00:41:00,160 --> 00:41:02,039
Dastard.

435
00:41:04,160 --> 00:41:05,719
What's written, my Bey?

436
00:41:06,880 --> 00:41:11,519
Karesi and Byzantine made
a plan against us together.

437
00:41:16,040 --> 00:41:19,799
Over there... Near Yassiova.

438
00:41:21,600 --> 00:41:23,809
He's going to hit the quarters with catapults.

439
00:41:23,809 --> 00:41:26,239
-Vile dog!
-He is!

440
00:41:26,800 --> 00:41:30,239
He's too scared to face us on the battlefield.

441
00:41:31,560 --> 00:41:34,519
We'll go there before catapults start shooting

442
00:41:34,600 --> 00:41:36,439
Bring the horses!

443
00:41:38,160 --> 00:41:41,039
Bayhan Bey, you have the command here.

444
00:41:41,040 --> 00:41:44,599
-Keep your eyes wide open.
-As you order, my Bey.

445
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:46,719
Let's go.

446
00:42:01,760 --> 00:42:03,479
Come on, alps!

447
00:42:03,960 --> 00:42:05,639
Keep training

448
00:42:09,600 --> 00:42:13,439
Karesi Bey did his part and got
Osman out of his headquarters.

449
00:42:24,840 --> 00:42:26,159
Get ready.

450
00:42:26,360 --> 00:42:28,959
Osman thinks the attack
will come from catapults.

451
00:42:29,360 --> 00:42:33,999
But hell will spread in his
headquarters with our swords!

452
00:42:45,320 --> 00:42:49,559
Commander Lukas, the convoy that
left Osman's tribe are approaching.

453
00:42:50,640 --> 00:42:53,479
It's your turn, Sofia.

454
00:42:54,440 --> 00:42:56,079
Come on, Sofia.

455
00:43:39,240 --> 00:43:41,199
Kill them all!

456
00:44:52,840 --> 00:44:55,799
Wear their alps' clothes!

457
00:44:56,280 --> 00:44:59,359
We're going to burn down their headquarters!

458
00:45:53,760 --> 00:45:57,199
-Are the catapults ready, Kanyumaz?
-Yes, my Bey.

459
00:45:57,720 --> 00:45:59,479
They're behind that hill.

460
00:45:59,760 --> 00:46:01,679
They're waiting for your call.

461
00:46:19,360 --> 00:46:21,039
Begum Hatun.

462
00:46:22,840 --> 00:46:28,439
I think... After we destroy
Osman's headquarters,

463
00:46:28,520 --> 00:46:32,919
...we should go back and get married just today.

464
00:46:35,400 --> 00:46:38,719
In such a time? What's the haste, my Bey?

465
00:46:40,320 --> 00:46:42,599
There are enemies..

466
00:46:42,880 --> 00:46:45,279
There are spies and traitors...

467
00:46:45,960 --> 00:46:50,959
There are many people who want
to stab me in the back, Begum Hatun.

468
00:46:51,640 --> 00:46:53,639
What do you mean, Karesi Bey?

469
00:46:53,840 --> 00:46:56,919
There may be no coming back.

470
00:46:57,440 --> 00:46:58,999
We should get married.

471
00:46:59,280 --> 00:47:03,479
So all my properties will
be yours if I die in the war.

472
00:47:05,720 --> 00:47:07,799
May Allah give you a long life, my Bey.

473
00:47:08,160 --> 00:47:10,319
I have no desire for properties.

474
00:47:10,680 --> 00:47:14,639
There's revenge I need
to take. I only want that.

475
00:47:18,620 --> 00:47:20,599
Kanyumaz.
-My Bey.

476
00:47:20,880 --> 00:47:22,719
Where are the catapults?

477
00:47:22,960 --> 00:47:25,119
Behind that hill, my Bey.

478
00:47:46,040 --> 00:47:48,559
You look so excited, Meryem.

479
00:47:50,320 --> 00:47:53,119
You did me such a favor, Fatma Hatun

480
00:47:53,720 --> 00:47:58,439
...that I thought I was left
alone in the morning, but...

481
00:48:00,720 --> 00:48:04,679
...I reached my biggest dream thanks to you.

482
00:48:07,080 --> 00:48:08,799
Come on.

483
00:48:13,200 --> 00:48:15,519
Let's make you settle in your tent first.

484
00:48:15,640 --> 00:48:18,319
Then we will join the training.

485
00:48:19,120 --> 00:48:22,639
Will Bala Hatun let me join Sisters?

486
00:48:23,000 --> 00:48:25,879
Mother Bala won't appreciate easily.

487
00:48:26,400 --> 00:48:29,079
But she will accept you.

488
00:48:30,040 --> 00:48:31,599
Let's go.

489
00:48:35,360 --> 00:48:36,239
Mother.

490
00:48:36,400 --> 00:48:40,479
The healing house's needs got
loaded in the cart. It's ready to leave.

491
00:48:40,480 --> 00:48:44,519
Good. When the other cart is
ready, make them leave immediately.

492
00:48:44,560 --> 00:48:46,399
As you order, mother.

493
00:48:48,800 --> 00:48:50,879
Bala Hatun.

494
00:48:51,960 --> 00:48:53,359
Kismet.

495
00:48:53,880 --> 00:48:55,439
Isn't Fatma here yet?

496
00:48:55,480 --> 00:48:56,919
She is.

497
00:48:56,960 --> 00:48:59,999
-She's brought a guest.
-A guest?

498
00:49:01,160 --> 00:49:03,159
Let's see who it is.

499
00:49:05,680 --> 00:49:07,279
Come on.

500
00:49:27,080 --> 00:49:29,239
There are no watchers or catapults...

501
00:49:29,720 --> 00:49:32,279
...on the hill or behind it.

502
00:49:32,920 --> 00:49:37,280
If the information we got is true, it
seems they haven't taken action yet.

503
00:49:38,280 --> 00:49:42,919
Even so,
there have to be a few watchmen at least.

504
00:49:45,920 --> 00:49:48,159
There is something else going on.

505
00:49:57,400 --> 00:49:59,959
What else, Osman?

506
00:50:21,200 --> 00:50:22,959
Karesi.

507
00:50:25,040 --> 00:50:28,039
Only Karesi? What about Bey?

508
00:50:28,320 --> 00:50:31,079
I don't care what others call you.

509
00:50:31,520 --> 00:50:34,399
You are only Karesi to me.

510
00:50:42,840 --> 00:50:44,719
So be it, Osman.

511
00:50:45,320 --> 00:50:46,799
So be it.

512
00:50:47,200 --> 00:50:49,799
Tell me. What are you looking for here?

513
00:50:53,040 --> 00:50:59,759
Are you here to see how more
powerful my army is than yours?

514
00:51:31,280 --> 00:51:35,879
We're going to destroy his quarters today.

515
00:51:37,560 --> 00:51:41,399
Look, Osman.
Look down carefully.

516
00:51:41,640 --> 00:51:43,319
Look carefully.

517
00:51:43,680 --> 00:51:46,479
We're in the field of truth.

518
00:51:52,280 --> 00:51:54,399
Field of truth, huh?

519
00:51:55,880 --> 00:51:57,639
What is the truth?

520
00:51:57,920 --> 00:52:00,199
The truth is..

521
00:52:00,560 --> 00:52:04,839
...that only one of us will survive here.

522
00:52:06,000 --> 00:52:09,479
And no matter what sins we committed,

523
00:52:10,720 --> 00:52:16,519
...the history will justify
the survivor in this field.

524
00:52:19,840 --> 00:52:23,159
Yes, of course.

525
00:52:23,640 --> 00:52:27,759
You're ready to commit any sins...

526
00:52:28,120 --> 00:52:31,279
...to get your name written...

527
00:52:32,320 --> 00:52:35,199
...among the best warriors and sultans.

528
00:52:36,080 --> 00:52:41,239
You wouldn't avoid working with
heathens against your own kin, right?

529
00:52:41,560 --> 00:52:44,039
-Ha?
-I wouldn't, Osman.

530
00:52:44,760 --> 00:52:50,959
When I become the only ruler of the frontiers,
I will take care of those heathens too.

531
00:52:51,080 --> 00:52:55,999
And then I will be ready to pay for my sins.

532
00:53:00,120 --> 00:53:07,279
Now tell me... You were looking for
catapults ready to shoot your quarters.

533
00:53:09,520 --> 00:53:11,759
Did you find them?

534
00:53:29,280 --> 00:53:31,799
Disgrace of Turks!

535
00:53:34,440 --> 00:53:36,319
Sister!

536
00:53:46,480 --> 00:53:48,519
My wife-to-be.

537
00:53:49,000 --> 00:53:52,559
Did you think your betrayal
wouldn't be revealed?

538
00:53:52,800 --> 00:53:56,039
You're the one who betrays!

539
00:53:59,120 --> 00:54:01,079
Don't, Osman.

540
00:54:01,400 --> 00:54:04,319
If you take one step closer,

541
00:54:04,640 --> 00:54:06,479
..your spy will die.

542
00:54:06,720 --> 00:54:08,319
Sister!

543
00:54:19,000 --> 00:54:20,479
You say..

544
00:54:21,920 --> 00:54:25,279
...you aren't going to hit
my quarters with catapults.

545
00:54:25,880 --> 00:54:27,119
Then tell me.

546
00:54:27,400 --> 00:54:29,519
What game are you up to?

547
00:54:29,800 --> 00:54:31,639
Be patient, Osman.

548
00:54:31,920 --> 00:54:33,399
You will find out.

549
00:54:33,640 --> 00:54:36,119
I didn't draw you here in vain.

550
00:54:36,480 --> 00:54:38,439
You will see it for sure.

551
00:55:01,680 --> 00:55:03,039
Get ready.

552
00:55:03,040 --> 00:55:05,559
Soon this place will turn into a bloodbath.

553
00:55:10,400 --> 00:55:12,199
Move the stakes.

554
00:55:12,360 --> 00:55:17,719
Kill the Alps. -Alps!

555
00:55:25,080 --> 00:55:26,599
Sofia

556
00:55:26,600 --> 00:55:29,479
Alps, take your positions.

557
00:55:37,920 --> 00:55:38,639
Go.

558
00:55:41,700 --> 00:55:43,459
Flying flames.

559
00:55:46,560 --> 00:55:48,439
I will not allow this.

560
00:56:23,200 --> 00:56:24,999
The headquarters...

561
00:56:31,560 --> 00:56:33,639
It should have exploded inside.

562
00:56:35,760 --> 00:56:37,759
Come on. Come on.

563
00:56:43,040 --> 00:56:49,719
I told you, those who show hostility and
disrespect to me will meet a terrible end.

564
00:56:50,520 --> 00:56:55,688
Now you paid the price of
your carelessness at your headquarters...

565
00:56:55,700 --> 00:57:01,079
...before this
battlefield where you faced me.

566
00:57:03,560 --> 00:57:09,039
It is forbidden for you to die
fighting in a battlefield, Karesi.

567
00:57:09,120 --> 00:57:10,879
I said don't, Osman.

568
00:57:10,920 --> 00:57:16,399
If you want Begum Hatun
to live, look down there now.

569
00:57:17,120 --> 00:57:21,479
Never forget the smoke you see.

570
00:57:25,640 --> 00:57:29,279
When I have your body
under my feet on the battlefield...

571
00:57:30,960 --> 00:57:35,759
...you will remember how I left you helpless.

572
00:57:37,200 --> 00:57:39,639
These are your last games...

573
00:57:40,120 --> 00:57:44,999
And this will be your last treachery.

574
00:57:46,840 --> 00:57:48,239
Draw your sword.

575
00:57:48,800 --> 00:57:50,079
Stand before me!

576
00:57:50,360 --> 00:57:53,159
-Let Begum Hatun go.
-No.

577
00:57:53,760 --> 00:57:55,839
Enough losses for you today.

578
00:57:55,840 --> 00:57:59,839
Save your strength for tomorrow.

579
00:58:02,800 --> 00:58:05,799
Just as you did in my castle..

580
00:58:06,280 --> 00:58:10,359
...I will leave this place
under Begum Hatun's shadow.

581
00:58:13,080 --> 00:58:17,119
Lukas will destroy your headquarters.

582
00:58:24,120 --> 00:58:26,679
Kanyumaz. -My Bey. -Take her.

583
00:58:28,080 --> 00:58:30,519
Sister, do not worry, we will save you.

584
00:58:30,520 --> 00:58:34,239
Nothing will happen to
me, brother, do not worry.

585
00:58:35,360 --> 00:58:37,319
Run Osman, run!

586
00:58:37,800 --> 00:58:40,999
Many lives are lost in your headquarters.

587
00:58:52,080 --> 00:58:54,399
Ilbay, Yusuf! -My Bey! -My Bey!

588
00:58:54,400 --> 00:58:56,199
Go after Karesi now.

589
00:58:56,200 --> 00:58:59,399
You will take Begum Hatun and
bring her back safe and sound.

590
00:58:59,400 --> 00:59:02,919
Yes my Bey. -Yes my Bey. -Alps!

591
00:59:03,560 --> 00:59:06,679
We are going to the
headquarters now! Immediately!

592
00:59:21,520 --> 00:59:25,759
Burn and destroy everything! Hurry!

593
00:59:32,680 --> 00:59:37,959
So you want to be a hero, Bayhan, huh?

594
00:59:37,960 --> 00:59:40,999
But today you will taste death.

595
00:59:41,000 --> 00:59:43,119
You dastard dog!

596
00:59:43,600 --> 00:59:46,999
We do not attack enemies from behind like you.

597
00:59:47,640 --> 00:59:49,359
Draw your sword.

598
01:00:01,280 --> 01:00:04,759
You will pay for betrayal
with your life. Bayhan.

599
01:00:04,920 --> 01:00:08,319
We do not fear paying the price, Lukas.

600
01:00:08,520 --> 01:00:12,039
Dogs keep breeding, wolves
walk on the path they believe.

601
01:01:00,840 --> 01:01:02,159
Sofia.

602
01:01:02,160 --> 01:01:05,559
Why are you letting him speak? Kill him already.

603
01:01:07,400 --> 01:01:09,679
Thanks to Allah..

604
01:01:09,960 --> 01:01:17,119
...I am not dying in my
bed but on the battlefield.

605
01:01:17,480 --> 01:01:19,679
Make your move, murderers!

606
01:01:42,920 --> 01:01:47,719
They do not write "a hero" on
the grave of a dead man, Bayhan.

607
01:01:48,720 --> 01:01:49,919
You..

608
01:01:53,960 --> 01:01:58,679
...will die for nothing.

609
01:01:58,960 --> 01:02:03,559
We fight to spread the
glorification of the Word of Allah.

610
01:02:03,960 --> 01:02:09,279
You might shed our blood, but
our revenge will be taken for sure.

611
01:02:10,080 --> 01:02:11,159
Then..

612
01:02:13,360 --> 01:02:14,759
..where is..

613
01:02:15,160 --> 01:02:17,239
..Osman?

614
01:02:20,880 --> 01:02:23,719
Who will save you from our hands?

615
01:02:24,320 --> 01:02:25,559
Look.

616
01:02:26,080 --> 01:02:27,799
Look around you!

617
01:02:32,080 --> 01:02:36,039
We set out on this journey with our shrouds.

618
01:02:38,200 --> 01:02:40,039
Allah is sufficient for us.

619
01:02:40,600 --> 01:02:42,599
He is the best protector.

620
01:03:00,200 --> 01:03:02,279
Now drown in your own blood, Bayhan.

621
01:03:03,600 --> 01:03:07,199
You will say your last words to Osman.

622
01:03:08,560 --> 01:03:09,599
Sofia.

623
01:03:30,440 --> 01:03:33,919
Finally, I entered into the heart of the enemy.

624
01:03:51,680 --> 01:03:52,759
Bala.

625
01:04:18,600 --> 01:04:20,919
My Halime!

626
01:04:21,320 --> 01:04:23,359
Stop!

627
01:04:27,200 --> 01:04:32,159
Let me see your face once, my daughter.

628
01:05:04,680 --> 01:05:06,399
Mother!

629
01:05:09,280 --> 01:05:13,479
Halime! Halime!

630
01:05:13,480 --> 01:05:15,759
My daughter!

631
01:05:15,760 --> 01:05:19,999
My child! Look everywhere! Look everywhere!

632
01:05:36,000 --> 01:05:38,999
My daughter...

633
01:05:46,160 --> 01:05:51,519
I have not seen you all this time.

634
01:06:07,760 --> 01:06:09,039
Who are you?

635
01:06:17,040 --> 01:06:17,959
Mother!

636
01:06:22,080 --> 01:06:24,039
I was looking for you.

637
01:06:24,040 --> 01:06:27,279
So you met.

638
01:06:29,080 --> 01:06:32,039
We just met.

639
01:06:33,640 --> 01:06:36,679
Welcome, my daughter.

640
01:06:36,840 --> 01:06:38,919
Thank you.

641
01:06:38,920 --> 01:06:43,719
I got excited when I saw you. Please forgive me.

642
01:06:43,720 --> 01:06:48,079
It's okay, daughter...

643
01:06:48,800 --> 01:06:50,239
Mother..

644
01:06:50,240 --> 01:06:53,559
I told you about Meryem.

645
01:06:53,560 --> 01:06:56,159
Her grandmother passed away.

646
01:06:56,160 --> 01:06:59,679
She wants to join the Sisters.

647
01:07:02,000 --> 01:07:02,959
Sure.

648
01:07:05,080 --> 01:07:09,959
You will be trained and become a Sister.

649
01:07:09,960 --> 01:07:13,359
My Fatma will take care of you.

650
01:07:19,040 --> 01:07:22,799
Is there no one else besides your grandmother?

651
01:07:23,320 --> 01:07:29,999
Years ago, the infidels raided our tribe.

652
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:33,639
They killed my mother and father.

653
01:07:34,720 --> 01:07:38,559
I want to join the Sisters...

654
01:07:38,560 --> 01:07:43,479
...and take their revenge, Bala Hatun.

655
01:08:34,399 --> 01:08:38,078
I am sorry for your loss, my Meryem daughter.

656
01:08:44,880 --> 01:08:48,278
I am sorry for your loss.

657
01:08:56,080 --> 01:08:58,679
Thank you.

658
01:08:59,200 --> 01:09:04,759
Now, I should go to my tent if you allow me.

659
01:09:08,319 --> 01:09:10,799
Why are you crying?

660
01:09:10,800 --> 01:09:16,359
Why do you tear up when you see that
woman and make yourself look weak?

661
01:09:17,029 --> 01:09:19,108
I will kill you Bala.

662
01:09:20,200 --> 01:09:23,468
I swear, I will kill you.

663
01:09:44,479 --> 01:09:47,879
She is a good girl.

664
01:09:47,880 --> 01:09:51,959
I couldn't resist when I saw her like that.

665
01:09:51,960 --> 01:09:54,679
My heart was broken into pieces.

666
01:09:54,680 --> 01:10:02,439
I said "No one is left alone
in Osman Bey's lands".

667
01:10:03,080 --> 01:10:05,879
Ah, my merciful daughter.

668
01:10:05,880 --> 01:10:09,039
You have thought very well.

669
01:11:04,760 --> 01:11:09,559
Alaeddin! -My Bey..
-Come, my son.

670
01:11:09,800 --> 01:11:12,959
Look, is he alive?

671
01:11:14,400 --> 01:11:16,239
He is a martyr, father.

672
01:11:16,240 --> 01:11:17,959
Check everyone!

673
01:11:17,960 --> 01:11:19,879
Take anyone who is still alive!

674
01:11:19,880 --> 01:11:23,079
Come on! Help!

675
01:11:27,240 --> 01:11:28,759
They are all martyrs.

676
01:11:28,760 --> 01:11:31,919
All of them.

677
01:11:42,560 --> 01:11:43,479
No.

678
01:11:45,040 --> 01:11:46,079
No.

679
01:11:57,000 --> 01:11:57,679
No.

680
01:11:58,840 --> 01:12:01,479
No, don't do this, father.

681
01:12:01,480 --> 01:12:07,199
Don't do this, father! No! Don't, father!

682
01:12:07,200 --> 01:12:09,839
Father! Father!

683
01:12:09,840 --> 01:12:14,119
Father, hang on, father!

684
01:12:16,680 --> 01:12:20,399
Bayhan Bey...

685
01:12:21,680 --> 01:12:24,519
Father... Father, stay with me.

686
01:12:25,160 --> 01:12:27,159
Bayhan Bey!

687
01:12:27,160 --> 01:12:29,799
Father... father..

688
01:12:29,800 --> 01:12:35,039
Father, open your eyes!
-Bayhan Bey...

689
01:12:35,040 --> 01:12:38,799
What happened? Alaeddin!
-Stay...

690
01:12:38,800 --> 01:12:40,399
Alaeddin Bey will treat you.

691
01:12:40,400 --> 01:12:43,679
Alaeddin, come.
He will recover, right, Alaeddin Bey?

692
01:12:43,680 --> 01:12:47,239
You came just in time, my son.

693
01:12:47,240 --> 01:12:50,999
Don't say that, father. Don't say that.

694
01:12:51,000 --> 01:12:52,199
Alaeddin Bey.

695
01:12:52,200 --> 01:12:54,479
You will heal my father, right?

696
01:12:54,480 --> 01:12:56,559
Don't leave me father.

697
01:12:56,560 --> 01:12:57,359
Son..

698
01:12:58,920 --> 01:13:03,639
Father... Father! -My son..

699
01:13:03,920 --> 01:13:05,759
Father!

700
01:13:05,760 --> 01:13:07,999
Don't leave me father!

701
01:13:08,000 --> 01:13:09,439
Don't leave me..

702
01:13:09,440 --> 01:13:10,839
Don't leave me father..

703
01:13:10,840 --> 01:13:14,399
Alaeddin Bey will heal you, father.. He will.

704
01:13:14,400 --> 01:13:18,799
You will heal my father, right?
-Son...

705
01:13:19,400 --> 01:13:22,119
Stop..

706
01:13:22,720 --> 01:13:25,519
Stop...

707
01:13:26,080 --> 01:13:28,839
Your father is telling you something.

708
01:13:30,320 --> 01:13:36,119
I am pleased with you, my son.

709
01:13:36,120 --> 01:13:41,199
May Allah be pleased with you as well.

710
01:13:44,160 --> 01:13:47,599
My Bey... My Bey...

711
01:13:47,600 --> 01:13:50,519
Tell me. Tell me.

712
01:13:50,520 --> 01:13:58,519
I devoted my blood and life to your path.

713
01:14:00,000 --> 01:14:03,719
Now... I am walking...

714
01:14:03,720 --> 01:14:07,039
..to shahada on that way.

715
01:14:07,040 --> 01:14:08,759
I just...

716
01:14:08,760 --> 01:14:11,439
..want you to..

717
01:14:11,560 --> 01:14:13,479
...take good...

718
01:14:13,480 --> 01:14:16,399
..care of my..

719
01:14:16,520 --> 01:14:19,479
..son Saruca.

720
01:14:20,480 --> 01:14:22,479
Don't worry.

721
01:14:22,480 --> 01:14:26,799
Your son is my son. Don't worry.

722
01:14:29,760 --> 01:14:32,439
My Bey... My Bey, stay...

723
01:14:32,440 --> 01:14:33,759
My Bey...

724
01:14:33,760 --> 01:14:38,759
I bear witness that there is none
worthy of worship except Allah...

725
01:14:38,760 --> 01:14:47,639
...and I bear witness that Muhammad
is His servant and Messenger.

726
01:14:49,800 --> 01:14:50,799
Father!

727
01:14:54,680 --> 01:14:55,719
Father!

728
01:15:02,440 --> 01:15:04,119
Father!

729
01:15:17,000 --> 01:15:21,559
Indeed we belong to Allah,
and indeed to Him we will return.

730
01:15:30,520 --> 01:15:32,119
I swear..

731
01:15:32,680 --> 01:15:34,759
I swear, my Bey...

732
01:15:34,760 --> 01:15:39,439
I swear I will take our revenge
from those who did this to you!

733
01:15:42,880 --> 01:15:47,799
We will, sure we will.

734
01:16:15,560 --> 01:16:19,959
Osman's headquarters is destroyed.

735
01:16:20,160 --> 01:16:23,639
Thanks to Begum Hatun.

736
01:16:25,280 --> 01:16:30,799
This is just the beginning, Lukas.

737
01:16:33,600 --> 01:16:37,239
My Beys do not know we are allies.

738
01:16:37,240 --> 01:16:43,719
When you come to the battlefield
to help, I will act as if I don't know.

739
01:16:43,720 --> 01:16:46,279
You understand, right?

740
01:16:46,280 --> 01:16:48,239
I do, Karesi Bey.

741
01:16:48,240 --> 01:16:51,679
Let's not scare your Beys.

742
01:17:00,720 --> 01:17:03,919
I swear... I swear..

743
01:17:03,920 --> 01:17:07,919
You will pay for this!

744
01:17:19,080 --> 01:17:20,039
Begum.

745
01:17:23,360 --> 01:17:27,999
I killed your enemy, Bayhan...

746
01:17:28,000 --> 01:17:33,999
But you are disrespecting me!
-Sofia...

747
01:17:35,000 --> 01:17:36,759
Kanyumaz.
-My Bey.

748
01:17:36,760 --> 01:17:40,359
Take this traitor the castle
and put her in the dungeon.

749
01:17:40,360 --> 01:17:44,879
I will punish her myself.

750
01:17:44,880 --> 01:17:47,519
We will save my sister
on the way Ilbay. Let's go.

751
01:17:47,520 --> 01:17:50,759
Yusuf, they are very crowded.

752
01:17:50,760 --> 01:17:54,359
We might put Begum Hatun's life at risk.

753
01:18:08,080 --> 01:18:12,079
What will we do then, Ilbay?

754
01:18:12,080 --> 01:18:16,879
-We will abduct Begum Hatun from the castle.
-How will we do that?

755
01:18:18,200 --> 01:18:21,439
By using you, Yusuf.

756
01:18:24,360 --> 01:18:26,839
Come on.

757
01:18:31,400 --> 01:18:35,189
Osman Bey Quarters

758
01:18:36,880 --> 01:18:40,599
The way Karesi attacked us...

759
01:18:40,600 --> 01:18:43,799
Even if we kill all of them...

760
01:18:43,800 --> 01:18:48,159
This is a wound that will not heal easily.

761
01:18:52,280 --> 01:18:54,239
How are ghazis doing?

762
01:18:55,320 --> 01:18:58,039
Some of them have serious wound, my Bey.

763
01:18:58,080 --> 01:19:00,639
We're doing our best to heal them.

764
01:19:00,640 --> 01:19:04,399
What about the places
that got hit in the quarters?

765
01:19:04,440 --> 01:19:08,399
The biggest damage happened in the
entrance of the headquarter, my Bey.

766
01:19:08,400 --> 01:19:12,039
Alps are working with great
effort to reinforce the wall.

767
01:19:12,440 --> 01:19:14,559
Cerkutay, Boran.

768
01:19:15,600 --> 01:19:17,359
What about alps?

769
01:19:18,000 --> 01:19:22,399
Since our alps became martyrs in the vile ambush

770
01:19:23,480 --> 01:19:26,319
...everybody has been grieved, my Bey.

771
01:19:27,560 --> 01:19:29,479
Especially Saruca Bey.

772
01:19:30,040 --> 01:19:33,599
May Allah give him strength and endurance.

773
01:19:34,600 --> 01:19:36,559
Aameen. Aameen.

774
01:19:36,840 --> 01:19:40,199
To make them pay for the
vile actions they did to us,

775
01:19:40,680 --> 01:19:42,599
..he has to stand up.

776
01:19:45,720 --> 01:19:47,359
Karesi...

777
01:19:47,680 --> 01:19:50,879
...will obviously collaborate with the heathens.

778
01:19:51,160 --> 01:19:53,559
But we won't let them.

779
01:19:54,440 --> 01:19:55,599
Orhan.

780
01:19:56,080 --> 01:19:58,159
-Boran, Cerkutay.
-My Bey.

781
01:19:59,200 --> 01:20:02,319
Keep your eyes on Lukas.

782
01:20:03,000 --> 01:20:05,399
In which castle is he keeping his army?

783
01:20:06,080 --> 01:20:07,999
Find out.

784
01:20:08,520 --> 01:20:11,399
Surround him in such a way..

785
01:20:11,640 --> 01:20:16,759
...that they won't be able to even take
a peek from the walls to join the battle.

786
01:20:17,200 --> 01:20:19,919
As you order, my Bey.
As you order, my Bey.

787
01:20:20,680 --> 01:20:22,559
-Alaaddin.
-My Bey.

788
01:20:23,280 --> 01:20:25,639
During the war between us and Karesi

789
01:20:26,640 --> 01:20:29,519
...you and Gonca will have a different mission.

790
01:20:30,000 --> 01:20:32,159
As you order, my Bey.

791
01:20:35,640 --> 01:20:37,479
Where is Fatma?

792
01:20:38,240 --> 01:20:41,799
She found a Sister, you
know. She sticks with her.

793
01:20:42,160 --> 01:20:44,719
She got a companion, huh?

794
01:20:45,080 --> 01:20:46,559
Good.

795
01:20:48,040 --> 01:20:51,959
Nobody had got close to her after Halime.

796
01:21:04,720 --> 01:21:06,719
-Mother.
-Yes?

797
01:21:07,680 --> 01:21:09,639
I don't want to itch your wound.

798
01:21:10,800 --> 01:21:12,079
But..

799
01:21:13,320 --> 01:21:16,199
I always wanted to ask Alaaddin, but I couldn't.

800
01:21:17,760 --> 01:21:19,959
How did Halime die?

801
01:21:23,760 --> 01:21:25,279
Actually

802
01:21:26,400 --> 01:21:28,679
..I want to know that too.

803
01:21:34,160 --> 01:21:35,799
Let me tell you.

804
01:21:39,200 --> 01:21:41,319
It's been ten years.

805
01:21:42,840 --> 01:21:45,079
We were having hard times.

806
01:21:46,200 --> 01:21:48,239
Osman Bey was at war.

807
01:21:49,240 --> 01:21:52,439
When Cerkutay Bey was taken captive,

808
01:21:53,640 --> 01:21:56,439
...each of us was fighting on another front.

809
01:21:58,080 --> 01:22:00,959
I went to welcome a tribe.

810
01:22:01,600 --> 01:22:04,239
Getting news about an attack,

811
01:22:07,440 --> 01:22:09,479
..I left her there.

812
01:22:12,040 --> 01:22:13,959
Halime fell down into the stream.

813
01:22:18,840 --> 01:22:20,479
Because of me.

814
01:22:21,720 --> 01:22:23,959
I couldn't protect her.

815
01:22:28,000 --> 01:22:29,799
It wasn't your fault, Ulgen.

816
01:22:31,040 --> 01:22:32,639
It's fate.

817
01:22:32,880 --> 01:22:35,239
We looked for her, but...

818
01:22:37,560 --> 01:22:39,519
Ten days...

819
01:22:41,960 --> 01:22:44,479
They found her ten days later.

820
01:22:46,720 --> 01:22:48,279
Halime!

821
01:22:55,040 --> 01:22:56,399
My baby!

822
01:22:58,960 --> 01:23:01,079
It's all because of me.

823
01:23:03,360 --> 01:23:09,399
I'm here, my baby. Where
are you? Halime! My daughter!

824
01:23:10,720 --> 01:23:12,359
Bala Hatun.

825
01:23:12,560 --> 01:23:16,039
It's been ten days! Get out
of water. You're going to die!

826
01:23:17,240 --> 01:23:19,119
Look carefully!

827
01:23:20,600 --> 01:23:22,679
My girl?

828
01:23:23,480 --> 01:23:25,999
It's easy to kill you, Bala.

829
01:23:27,280 --> 01:23:30,759
I killed you while you were alive, though.

830
01:23:36,280 --> 01:23:38,319
Your daughter is mine now.

831
01:23:39,560 --> 01:23:42,959
I will turn her against you.

832
01:23:43,120 --> 01:23:46,319
She will be your biggest enemy.

833
01:23:47,160 --> 01:23:48,839
My baby!

834
01:23:49,920 --> 01:23:53,439
We left the corpse in the stream.
She has Halime's clothes on her.

835
01:23:53,520 --> 01:23:55,519
Her face is burned, though.

836
01:23:56,160 --> 01:24:02,959
-Neither of her parents can recognize her.
-They'll find her soon.

837
01:24:04,240 --> 01:24:06,159
Halime!

838
01:24:07,160 --> 01:24:09,519
Your mother is here!

839
01:24:10,280 --> 01:24:11,919
Come on, Bala.

840
01:24:12,960 --> 01:24:14,439
Come on.

841
01:24:14,920 --> 01:24:15,959
Halime!

842
01:24:18,960 --> 01:24:21,039
Bala Hatun, Bala Hatun.

843
01:24:27,400 --> 01:24:29,079
My girl...

844
01:24:29,680 --> 01:24:31,399
Halime.

845
01:24:32,080 --> 01:24:33,599
Halime.

846
01:24:37,560 --> 01:24:39,479
Halime!

847
01:24:45,800 --> 01:24:47,799
Halime?

848
01:24:48,600 --> 01:24:50,879
Halime..

849
01:24:53,640 --> 01:24:56,039
Bala Hatun, don't look.

850
01:24:57,600 --> 01:25:00,039
My girl... Is this you?

851
01:25:00,080 --> 01:25:04,039
Bala Hatun, don't turn her around. Don't look.

852
01:25:32,680 --> 01:25:35,479
Halime!

853
01:25:40,640 --> 01:25:43,279
Halime, is this you?

854
01:25:45,000 --> 01:25:48,879
It's alright. It's alright, my dear.

855
01:25:49,360 --> 01:25:54,359
It's alright, my dear.
Your mother is here.

856
01:25:55,280 --> 01:25:57,679
You'll get warm now, my baby.

857
01:26:13,440 --> 01:26:17,679
We got attacked and defeated. We lost too many.

858
01:26:17,920 --> 01:26:20,479
Cerkutay Bey is missing.

859
01:26:21,840 --> 01:26:23,759
Ulgen..

860
01:26:24,840 --> 01:26:28,519
-Sit down.
Oh Cerkutay...

861
01:26:48,800 --> 01:26:50,639
What happened afterwards?

862
01:26:51,840 --> 01:26:53,519
While Halime was missing

863
01:26:55,040 --> 01:26:58,159
..Bala never slept.

864
01:27:00,560 --> 01:27:02,919
For ten days.

865
01:27:04,560 --> 01:27:06,519
Then she slept.

866
01:27:12,760 --> 01:27:16,039
We got afraid that she wouldn't wake up again.

867
01:27:16,480 --> 01:27:20,039
-Let me take some fresh air.
-Ulgen. Ulgen.

868
01:27:20,600 --> 01:27:23,239
Is your patience made of steel?

869
01:27:23,960 --> 01:27:26,319
You should have taken my life.

870
01:27:30,960 --> 01:27:34,879
You lost your husband and I lost my child.

871
01:27:35,920 --> 01:27:38,159
But you were always there for me.

872
01:27:38,160 --> 01:27:40,199
You healed my wounds.

873
01:27:44,280 --> 01:27:46,519
You are my sister, Ulgen.

874
01:28:01,640 --> 01:28:08,679
Lullaby, my dear baby

875
01:28:08,680 --> 01:28:15,799
Sleep well in your dream

876
01:28:15,800 --> 01:28:18,559
Quietly and stilly

877
01:28:19,240 --> 01:28:24,199
Mother. Mother, is that you?

878
01:28:28,880 --> 01:28:30,799
Mother.

879
01:29:02,600 --> 01:29:04,399
Mother.

880
01:29:05,000 --> 01:29:06,639
Mother, don't go.

881
01:29:07,320 --> 01:29:09,559
Mother. Mother..

882
01:29:22,640 --> 01:29:25,279
Why don't you show your face to me, mother?

883
01:29:29,600 --> 01:29:31,959
Will you come to my dreams...

884
01:29:32,880 --> 01:29:37,199
...when I kill them as my aunt says?

885
01:29:46,560 --> 01:29:48,799
I promise you.

886
01:29:49,520 --> 01:29:51,839
To be able to see you

887
01:29:53,880 --> 01:29:55,239
..I will kill them.

888
01:29:56,840 --> 01:29:59,799
Karesiogullari Beylic

889
01:29:59,800 --> 01:30:04,759
When I get out of here, I will drain your
source of arrogance increasing your appetite...

890
01:30:04,760 --> 01:30:07,839
...and prevent your vile intentions, Karesi Bey.

891
01:30:17,040 --> 01:30:18,799
Dastards!

892
01:30:22,560 --> 01:30:25,959
I want no food or water
from you! Get out of my sight!

893
01:30:28,240 --> 01:30:31,039
You don't want it? Your choice.

894
01:30:31,440 --> 01:30:34,839
You'll eat insects due to
starvation and come around.

895
01:30:35,000 --> 01:30:36,959
You think I'm afraid of hunger?

896
01:30:37,160 --> 01:30:43,399
I'd rather die than eat one
piece of food from traitors like you

897
01:30:51,440 --> 01:30:53,159
Move, move!

898
01:30:53,840 --> 01:30:56,519
Where are you bringing this traitor from?

899
01:30:56,920 --> 01:30:58,279
Coward

900
01:30:58,440 --> 01:31:01,279
Untie my hands and I will
show you who the traitor is!

901
01:31:01,480 --> 01:31:04,879
Wait, traitor's brother. Just be patient.

902
01:31:05,440 --> 01:31:10,799
Not your hands but your
tongue will be untied first.

903
01:31:14,960 --> 01:31:18,039
He was watching the castle walls in the south.

904
01:31:18,280 --> 01:31:21,159
He was hiding like a bear watching the beehive.

905
01:31:21,560 --> 01:31:25,839
I was going to kill him, but
he is Begum Hatun's brother.

906
01:31:26,000 --> 01:31:29,759
I didn't know what Karesi Bey
would do so I brought him here.

907
01:31:29,760 --> 01:31:31,919
Let's take him into the dungeon.

908
01:31:32,640 --> 01:31:37,079
Move, move!
-Easy, man.

909
01:31:43,240 --> 01:31:46,879
Yusuf, I was just with your sister.

910
01:31:47,160 --> 01:31:49,639
She'll be very happy to see you.

911
01:31:50,240 --> 01:31:54,119
-If she is harmed even slightly...
-Shut up!

912
01:31:54,400 --> 01:31:56,599
Your sister has a title.

913
01:31:56,840 --> 01:31:58,319
We know that.

914
01:31:58,600 --> 01:32:01,599
But you are nothing.

915
01:32:05,160 --> 01:32:08,519
You did a good job by bringing this traitor.

916
01:32:09,120 --> 01:32:12,797
But this is the first time
I see you. Who are you?

917
01:32:12,809 --> 01:32:14,039
You're right.

918
01:32:14,560 --> 01:32:16,359
I'm new here.

919
01:32:16,880 --> 01:32:21,519
And as to who I am... I'm the alp of
Osman Bey, descendant of Oghuz!

920
01:32:21,600 --> 01:32:23,199
O Allah

921
01:32:30,720 --> 01:32:32,319
You dog

922
01:32:32,360 --> 01:32:33,999
Ilbay!

923
01:32:34,840 --> 01:32:38,559
This dog said he was just with my sister.

924
01:32:38,880 --> 01:32:41,199
The dungeon must be that way.

925
01:32:41,360 --> 01:32:43,837
Let's save Begum Hatun
before everybody wakes up.

926
01:32:43,849 --> 01:32:44,679
Let's go.

927
01:32:46,760 --> 01:32:49,519
Osman Bey Quarters

928
01:32:58,200 --> 01:33:00,679
Attention! Osman Bey!

929
01:33:27,080 --> 01:33:29,039
Alps!

930
01:33:33,640 --> 01:33:36,119
Why does everyone have sullen faces?

931
01:33:38,040 --> 01:33:41,319
Tell me! Why is everyone grieved?

932
01:33:41,360 --> 01:33:46,759
My Bey, they raided our quarters
before we even reached the battlefield.

933
01:33:47,120 --> 01:33:51,079
They killed our Bey, Osman
Bey! That's why we are upset.

934
01:33:57,200 --> 01:33:59,919
You say we should draw back from the war?

935
01:34:00,880 --> 01:34:02,039
Tell me.

936
01:34:02,320 --> 01:34:04,639
You think we should draw back?

937
01:34:06,400 --> 01:34:11,439
Do you want to die in unawareness?

938
01:34:12,840 --> 01:34:19,039
Or do you want to become martyrs
standing upright like the letter "alif"?

939
01:34:19,080 --> 01:34:21,879
We want to become martyrs!

940
01:34:22,320 --> 01:34:24,439
Then get your heads up.

941
01:34:26,400 --> 01:34:28,519
Didn't I tell you

942
01:34:30,440 --> 01:34:32,599
There's no victory without suffering?

943
01:34:32,800 --> 01:34:34,759
This path has thorns.

944
01:34:35,680 --> 01:34:37,319
In this path,

945
01:34:37,960 --> 01:34:39,679
...there is pain

946
01:34:40,440 --> 01:34:41,719
..blood...

947
01:34:42,080 --> 01:34:43,999
...and life.

948
01:34:45,560 --> 01:34:47,319
Didn't I teach you this?

949
01:34:47,440 --> 01:34:49,879
You did

950
01:34:52,440 --> 01:34:58,559
If there is a fire to be started in these lands

951
01:35:00,160 --> 01:35:02,399
...only we can start it.

952
01:35:02,960 --> 01:35:05,319
If there is a fire to be extinguished,

953
01:35:05,960 --> 01:35:08,879
...only we can extinguish it.

954
01:35:11,680 --> 01:35:15,199
-Stop being hopeless already.
-As you order, my Bey!

955
01:35:17,640 --> 01:35:19,439
Saruca.

956
01:35:20,240 --> 01:35:21,679
My Bey.

957
01:35:21,880 --> 01:35:23,439
A Turk...

958
01:35:24,280 --> 01:35:26,039
..can live without a father.

959
01:35:29,040 --> 01:35:31,399
But he can never live without a homeland.

960
01:35:34,560 --> 01:35:36,799
A Bey is required for the homeland.

961
01:35:37,160 --> 01:35:42,399
And the most important
thing for a Bey is weapon.

962
01:35:57,680 --> 01:36:00,279
Bayhan Bey's sword.

963
01:36:02,360 --> 01:36:04,239
It's yours now.

964
01:36:06,080 --> 01:36:10,319
Be worthy of your state,
your morals and nation...

965
01:36:12,320 --> 01:36:14,359
..all the time.

966
01:36:18,040 --> 01:36:19,919
As you command my Bey.

967
01:36:31,080 --> 01:36:33,759
Put grief and sadness aside for now.

968
01:36:34,320 --> 01:36:36,119
No hopelessness!

969
01:36:36,640 --> 01:36:38,319
From now on

970
01:36:39,440 --> 01:36:41,679
..it's time to choke the enemy.

971
01:36:41,760 --> 01:36:44,279
Allah is the greatest!

972
01:36:44,360 --> 01:36:51,719
Allah is the greatest!
Allah is the greatest!

973
01:37:04,840 --> 01:37:07,359
Yusuf, what are you doing here?

974
01:37:07,520 --> 01:37:10,719
I couldn't have left you to
those dogs. Are you alright?

975
01:37:10,960 --> 01:37:14,159
-I'm fine.
-They're going to take Begum Hatun out! Run!

976
01:37:14,880 --> 01:37:17,199
Yusuf, just leave.

977
01:37:17,400 --> 01:37:20,599
They have Cain's sickness.
They killed Bayhan Bey.

978
01:37:20,720 --> 01:37:24,319
-They'll kill you too.
-I will never leave you, sister. No!

979
01:37:28,640 --> 01:37:30,719
Come here!

980
01:37:32,520 --> 01:37:34,719
Don't shed brother's blood

981
01:37:54,920 --> 01:37:57,159
Even if this leads us to death

982
01:37:58,840 --> 01:38:01,439
...we will get out of here together.

983
01:38:03,720 --> 01:38:06,119
People are coming. Let's go!

984
01:38:06,680 --> 01:38:08,079
How will we get out?

985
01:38:08,120 --> 01:38:11,079
Everybody will wake up shortly.
-Ilbay took care of that.

986
01:38:11,080 --> 01:38:13,999
A cart is waiting in front of the soup
kitchen. They won't even know. Let's go.

987
01:38:14,000 --> 01:38:17,359
Let's put these dogs in the
dungeon first. So nobody will notice.

988
01:38:17,400 --> 01:38:19,199
Come on.

989
01:38:26,880 --> 01:38:29,319
Osman Bey Quarters

990
01:38:30,800 --> 01:38:35,119
When you join the army,
let my alps know this well.

991
01:38:35,560 --> 01:38:38,159
Whoever avoids fighting on the battlefield...

992
01:38:38,520 --> 01:38:41,479
...or hesitates for a moment
won't be forgiven by me.

993
01:38:41,800 --> 01:38:43,799
As you order my Bey.

994
01:38:44,120 --> 01:38:46,959
Brothers, Saruca isn't doing well.

995
01:38:47,280 --> 01:38:49,399
He wants revenge.
That's alright, but...

996
01:38:49,720 --> 01:38:52,519
...he seems to be blinded by his ambition.

997
01:38:57,360 --> 01:38:59,479
...Osman Bey won't mind his suffering...

998
01:38:59,720 --> 01:39:01,239
...but punish him.

999
01:39:01,560 --> 01:39:03,439
You're right, brother.

1000
01:39:12,720 --> 01:39:15,399
Attention, Osman Bey!

1001
01:39:16,480 --> 01:39:18,519
Begum Hatun.

1002
01:39:19,280 --> 01:39:20,479
Osman Bey.

1003
01:39:20,680 --> 01:39:23,599
Alps have brought you here alive.

1004
01:39:27,080 --> 01:39:28,919
I'm grateful.

1005
01:39:31,000 --> 01:39:33,279
Now that you're here to fight...

1006
01:39:33,800 --> 01:39:38,159
Saruca, you will hold the right wing.

1007
01:39:39,240 --> 01:39:40,879
As you order, my Bey.

1008
01:39:41,400 --> 01:39:42,719
Begum Hatun.

1009
01:39:42,920 --> 01:39:45,279
You'll lead the left wing.

1010
01:39:46,120 --> 01:39:48,119
Your wish is my command my Bey.

1011
01:39:48,520 --> 01:39:50,759
But I need to tell you this.

1012
01:39:51,200 --> 01:39:53,879
Karesi Bey got Lukas and Sofia's support.

1013
01:39:54,040 --> 01:39:56,319
They will be powerful in the field.

1014
01:39:56,320 --> 01:39:58,599
I know that.

1015
01:39:59,080 --> 01:40:01,599
Boran Bey and Cerkutay Bey...

1016
01:40:02,480 --> 01:40:04,279
...are on duty now.

1017
01:40:04,640 --> 01:40:08,199
We prepared some plans to
keep them away from the field.

1018
01:40:09,320 --> 01:40:12,119
Come on! Everybody to work!

1019
01:40:12,680 --> 01:40:16,319
I need to handle something before the battle.

1020
01:40:17,120 --> 01:40:18,999
Come on, alps.

1021
01:40:38,280 --> 01:40:41,679
You are surprised because I
called you, right, Kanyumaz?

1022
01:40:42,160 --> 01:40:47,279
I was able to do so many things thanks to Yakup
Bey, Gonca Hatun. I came here for his sake.

1023
01:40:47,720 --> 01:40:49,599
So you care about old days.

1024
01:40:50,720 --> 01:40:51,839
Right?

1025
01:40:52,960 --> 01:40:56,759
Your humanity hasn't completely
disappeared, has it, Kanyumaz?

1026
01:40:57,040 --> 01:41:00,959
If you don't have anything else
to say, Gonca Hatun, I should go.

1027
01:41:00,960 --> 01:41:01,999
I do.

1028
01:41:03,600 --> 01:41:05,759
I do have something to say, Kanyumaz.

1029
01:41:07,640 --> 01:41:09,959
I've known you since I was a child.

1030
01:41:11,440 --> 01:41:15,747
When did you become someone who works
with infidel and sheds brother's blood?

1031
01:41:15,759 --> 01:41:17,199
Don't, Gonca Hatun.

1032
01:41:17,200 --> 01:41:18,599
Shut up!

1033
01:41:20,560 --> 01:41:26,919
What's the fault of Karesi Bey's Alps
because he works with the infidels Kanyumaz?

1034
01:41:30,360 --> 01:41:33,919
You have children too. Isn't it a sin?

1035
01:41:36,240 --> 01:41:41,359
What you've done will only
make Sofia and Lukas happy.

1036
01:41:41,960 --> 01:41:43,519
My Alaeddin Bey...

1037
01:41:44,040 --> 01:41:45,599
Gonca Hatun.

1038
01:41:46,280 --> 01:41:48,199
This is painful for me too.

1039
01:41:48,680 --> 01:41:50,479
But that's the order.

1040
01:41:51,640 --> 01:41:52,919
Kanyumaz.

1041
01:41:54,920 --> 01:41:57,199
Because of Karesi Bey's greed...

1042
01:41:57,880 --> 01:42:03,159
...his carelessness, we cannot allow even a
single drop of Turkish blood to be spilled.

1043
01:42:06,280 --> 01:42:09,959
If you still carry this in your heart..

1044
01:42:12,080 --> 01:42:13,919
..you will do as I say.

1045
01:42:29,760 --> 01:42:33,226
Akhisar, the fortress
of the army, which is the...

1046
01:42:33,238 --> 01:42:37,079
...leader of discord and which
wants to set Turks against each other.

1047
01:42:43,480 --> 01:42:46,239
I have an unfinished plan with you.

1048
01:42:55,280 --> 01:42:56,479
Orhan Bey...

1049
01:42:57,160 --> 01:43:00,919
Lukas's army is ready to leave Akhisar.

1050
01:43:02,120 --> 01:43:03,399
In vain.

1051
01:43:04,800 --> 01:43:07,359
They won't even be able to look around.

1052
01:43:20,360 --> 01:43:23,260
We will destroy this devilish
army which spreads fitna

1053
01:43:23,272 --> 01:43:26,079
and wants brothers to kill
each other with catapults.

1054
01:43:27,040 --> 01:43:28,959
-Oghuz.
-My Bey.

1055
01:43:29,000 --> 01:43:31,559
Are Boran and Cerkutay Beys ready?
-Yes, my Bey.

1056
01:43:31,560 --> 01:43:33,599
They're waiting for your order to fire.

1057
01:43:33,920 --> 01:43:37,399
With my order, the attacks
will come from all directions.

1058
01:43:37,400 --> 01:43:43,079
Everyone in Akhisar will think they
are surrounded by an entire army.

1059
01:43:43,480 --> 01:43:48,639
They will never unite with Karesi Bey.

1060
01:44:01,880 --> 01:44:07,909
Turkmens who have been beating
the walls of Bithynia...

1061
01:44:07,909 --> 01:44:13,359
and disturbed peace for years will
kill each other on the battlefield today.

1062
01:44:13,400 --> 01:44:17,399
Do you know about the great Caesar, Lukas?

1063
01:44:17,400 --> 01:44:21,639
The great Roman Emperor
Caesar? How would I not know him?

1064
01:44:21,640 --> 01:44:24,639
Every soldier dreams of being like him one day.

1065
01:44:25,920 --> 01:44:33,079
Great Caesar was killed by
nobles consumed by power.

1066
01:44:34,600 --> 01:44:41,799
And now that same evil ambition is among
the remnants of the Seljuks, the Turks.

1067
01:44:42,440 --> 01:44:46,999
And that will never fade until someone dies.

1068
01:44:51,440 --> 01:44:59,519
I will unite my army with Karesi's army
and erase Osman from history forever.

1069
01:45:02,320 --> 01:45:04,919
The army is ready to set out, Commander Lukas.

1070
01:45:07,080 --> 01:45:09,639
Today, our army will defeat Osman.

1071
01:45:10,000 --> 01:45:12,159
And my precious Poena...

1072
01:45:13,120 --> 01:45:16,919
...will destroy everything Osman has.

1073
01:45:23,120 --> 01:45:24,799
Set up the catapults.

1074
01:45:27,520 --> 01:45:35,159
The castle of the dastards who have the blood
of Bayhan and our martyrs on their hands.

1075
01:45:36,520 --> 01:45:39,359
It will soon turn into the pits of hell.

1076
01:45:39,760 --> 01:45:44,479
But for now, the walls will
be destroyed by catapults...

1077
01:45:45,640 --> 01:45:48,399
..and the army will be trapped inside.

1078
01:46:02,160 --> 01:46:06,599
In the name of Allah, the merficul,
the compassionate.

1079
01:46:21,080 --> 01:46:24,599
What is this? What is happening?

1080
01:46:24,600 --> 01:46:26,279
Come on Alps!

1081
01:46:26,400 --> 01:46:30,119
Let's bring down the enemy's
unclean and unholy walls.

1082
01:46:30,120 --> 01:46:32,439
Set it!

1083
01:46:33,320 --> 01:46:35,319
Set it, lions!

1084
01:46:40,120 --> 01:46:42,359
What's happening

1085
01:46:42,360 --> 01:46:43,199
Sir, Turks.

1086
01:46:43,200 --> 01:46:47,119
Turks are attacking the walls with catapults.
-Turks How is this possible??

1087
01:46:47,120 --> 01:46:50,719
Damn it, when did they surround us?
-Osman...

1088
01:46:52,000 --> 01:46:54,039
He must have done this.

1089
01:46:54,600 --> 01:46:56,959
Strengthen the gates immediately.

1090
01:46:56,960 --> 01:46:59,439
Place soldiers on the walls.

1091
01:46:59,880 --> 01:47:02,849
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

1092
01:47:03,520 --> 01:47:05,319
O The Righteous!

1093
01:47:11,200 --> 01:47:14,399
Allah is The Greatest!

1094
01:47:15,880 --> 01:47:17,519
O Allah!

1095
01:47:19,480 --> 01:47:20,879
O Allah

1096
01:47:27,920 --> 01:47:29,559
O The Righteous!

1097
01:47:36,520 --> 01:47:37,879
Set it...

1098
01:47:41,080 --> 01:47:46,879
We were on our way to the headquarters,
but why did Karesi Bey call us, Beys?

1099
01:47:46,880 --> 01:47:53,159
If the messenger wasn't Kanyumaz
Bey's man, I would say it's a trap.

1100
01:47:59,960 --> 01:48:01,879
Peace be upon you.

1101
01:48:03,280 --> 01:48:06,319
What is Osman Bey doing here?

1102
01:48:06,320 --> 01:48:07,759
Osman Bey.

1103
01:48:07,760 --> 01:48:10,199
So it was you who called us here.

1104
01:48:10,720 --> 01:48:12,599
Welcome, Beys.

1105
01:48:14,200 --> 01:48:15,839
Welcome.

1106
01:48:16,000 --> 01:48:19,599
They've bought Kanyumaz's
men. They're playing a game.

1107
01:48:20,120 --> 01:48:22,399
Turhan, close the door.

1108
01:48:22,640 --> 01:48:24,079
Yes my Bey.

1109
01:48:24,080 --> 01:48:26,879
Nobody leaves without your permission.

1110
01:48:27,280 --> 01:48:31,639
Wait, Beys. Wait. Stand there please.

1111
01:48:33,880 --> 01:48:34,919
Now..

1112
01:48:36,120 --> 01:48:37,319
...you are Beys..

1113
01:48:38,720 --> 01:48:40,679
...who know the Turkish traditions...

1114
01:48:42,640 --> 01:48:45,199
...who fight for the world of Islam...

1115
01:48:46,320 --> 01:48:51,839
...and who fight in the
battlefield with great bravery.

1116
01:48:54,560 --> 01:48:56,959
Karesi Bey, who you follow...

1117
01:48:58,080 --> 01:49:00,439
His way is not the right way anymore.

1118
01:49:02,200 --> 01:49:06,119
That careless man has
strayed from the path of The Righteous...

1119
01:49:07,080 --> 01:49:09,759
...and disobeyed the orders of The Righteous.

1120
01:49:11,840 --> 01:49:19,759
He even worked with infidels against
his own people and coreligionists.

1121
01:49:19,880 --> 01:49:21,679
Prove it, Osman Bey.

1122
01:49:21,680 --> 01:49:23,439
Prove it first.

1123
01:49:24,000 --> 01:49:26,159
You are just accusing him.

1124
01:49:26,560 --> 01:49:28,559
So you want proof, huh?

1125
01:49:31,840 --> 01:49:32,879
Turhan.

1126
01:49:39,440 --> 01:49:40,959
Kanyumaz?

1127
01:49:43,720 --> 01:49:46,159
Did he betray our Karesi Bey?

1128
01:49:46,440 --> 01:49:47,599
He would not.

1129
01:49:48,720 --> 01:49:50,599
Allah Allah! What is he doing here?

1130
01:49:50,600 --> 01:49:53,399
So that you want to hear the truth...

1131
01:49:54,480 --> 01:49:56,959
Kanyumaz. -Beys.

1132
01:49:58,000 --> 01:50:00,399
Osman Bey is telling the truth.

1133
01:50:00,880 --> 01:50:03,839
Karesi Bey started working with the infidels.

1134
01:50:04,080 --> 01:50:10,319
He even tried selling steel
which would kill our men to them.

1135
01:50:10,360 --> 01:50:14,079
They both made an agreement
and are slandering our Karesi Bey.

1136
01:50:14,080 --> 01:50:15,479
That would never happen

1137
01:50:16,080 --> 01:50:17,879
Karesi Bey would never do that!

1138
01:50:17,880 --> 01:50:20,839
He did it. He did.

1139
01:50:21,440 --> 01:50:25,199
You better not walk on Karesi Bey's path.

1140
01:50:26,440 --> 01:50:32,879
If you keep walking on
his path, you should know...

1141
01:50:34,320 --> 01:50:36,239
Then your end will be horrible.

1142
01:51:03,440 --> 01:51:05,679
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you, too.

1143
01:51:05,680 --> 01:51:08,599
The attacks continue without
stopping, my Shahzade.

1144
01:51:08,600 --> 01:51:11,799
We are attacking Akhisar
from all sides with catapults.

1145
01:51:11,840 --> 01:51:13,039
God willing.

1146
01:51:13,320 --> 01:51:17,879
We will really besiege the
fortress of this devil soon, my Bey.

1147
01:51:17,880 --> 01:51:20,679
We will besiege it. We will.

1148
01:51:20,680 --> 01:51:24,999
But let Lukas and his army be
trapped inside that fortress first.

1149
01:51:25,000 --> 01:51:27,879
Karesi Bey will be alone in the war.

1150
01:51:30,040 --> 01:51:31,599
It will be then Akhisar's turn.

1151
01:51:31,600 --> 01:51:34,999
God willing. God willing.

1152
01:51:36,360 --> 01:51:37,519
God willing.

1153
01:52:00,440 --> 01:52:02,799
-Where are they?
-They are everywhere, sir.

1154
01:52:02,800 --> 01:52:05,519
The attacks are hitting
every part of the fortress.

1155
01:52:05,520 --> 01:52:08,639
I cannot see
Osman's army around.

1156
01:52:09,000 --> 01:52:13,759
It seems they are hiding
behind the trees, waiting to attack.

1157
01:52:17,280 --> 01:52:20,737
Now that the devil's dogs
have faced the stones,

1158
01:52:20,749 --> 01:52:24,359
they will be scared of
getting out of the fortress.

1159
01:52:24,360 --> 01:52:26,519
But we will be careful.

1160
01:52:26,520 --> 01:52:29,759
They will not doubt the
siege for a single moment.

1161
01:52:30,480 --> 01:52:32,159
And that Karesi Bey...

1162
01:52:32,960 --> 01:52:35,759
Karesi Bey will be alone in the war.

1163
01:52:51,040 --> 01:52:53,959
Right now! Send the watchmen

1164
01:52:54,400 --> 01:52:58,317
Tell them to find the
location of Osman's army! Go!

1165
01:52:58,329 --> 01:52:59,639
Osman.

1166
01:53:00,560 --> 01:53:04,119
I will fill every hole you made in my walls...

1167
01:53:05,040 --> 01:53:10,279
...with your Alps' bones.

1168
01:53:10,280 --> 01:53:14,639
Now is the time for war. Come on!

1169
01:53:14,640 --> 01:53:19,199
Let's not leave my Bey
alone in his fight with Karesi.

1170
01:53:43,720 --> 01:53:45,399
Did Gonca return, Kismet?

1171
01:53:45,400 --> 01:53:47,239
No, my Hatun, she hasn't returned.

1172
01:53:48,200 --> 01:53:52,559
My Bala Hatun, why did we
come to the graveyard at this hour?

1173
01:53:52,760 --> 01:53:54,639
Did you see a dream again?

1174
01:53:55,480 --> 01:53:57,879
It's always the same dream, Kismet.

1175
01:53:58,040 --> 01:54:00,879
It seems Halime is expecting prayers from me.

1176
01:54:01,440 --> 01:54:02,799
Lately...

1177
01:54:03,600 --> 01:54:06,279
..I have a tightness in my chest.

1178
01:54:06,320 --> 01:54:10,959
You feel that way because Osman
Bey and the Shahzades are at war.

1179
01:54:10,960 --> 01:54:13,639
God willing, they will all return safe and sound.

1180
01:54:13,720 --> 01:54:15,039
God willing.

1181
01:54:20,680 --> 01:54:22,639
Give me the water.

1182
01:54:24,200 --> 01:54:26,559
You go to the Sisters, Kismet.

1183
01:54:26,960 --> 01:54:28,599
Tell them to be ready.

1184
01:54:28,600 --> 01:54:31,719
If they need us, we will go and help them.

1185
01:54:37,920 --> 01:54:39,399
My Halime...

1186
01:54:41,160 --> 01:54:43,519
In the name of Allah, the merficul,
the compassionate.

1187
01:55:21,160 --> 01:55:24,359
I will kill you today, Bala.

1188
01:55:47,640 --> 01:55:55,119
So Kanyumaz called you to Osman's
presence on behalf of me, huh?

1189
01:55:56,800 --> 01:56:04,119
So Kanyumaz gave false testimony against me.

1190
01:56:04,320 --> 01:56:07,639
We never trust their words, my Bey.

1191
01:56:07,640 --> 01:56:11,919
Who knows what they gave to
Kanyumaz to make him say that, my Bey?

1192
01:56:12,800 --> 01:56:14,719
Oh Kanyumaz.

1193
01:56:15,120 --> 01:56:19,399
I will eventually capture and
punish you.

1194
01:56:25,160 --> 01:56:27,839
Come, Osman, come.

1195
01:56:28,760 --> 01:56:29,919
Come.

1196
01:56:30,640 --> 01:56:33,319
Come to your death. Come.

1197
01:56:49,880 --> 01:56:51,199
Be proud.

1198
01:56:52,840 --> 01:56:54,599
Be proud, Karesi.

1199
01:56:59,120 --> 01:57:00,359
Today...

1200
01:57:02,320 --> 01:57:05,559
You will become as small
as a grain of this land.

1201
01:57:29,280 --> 01:57:30,799
My Halime.

1202
01:57:31,800 --> 01:57:33,559
My beautiful daughter.

1203
01:57:34,680 --> 01:57:36,239
I am here.

1204
01:57:40,240 --> 01:57:41,719
I am here.

1205
01:57:48,800 --> 01:57:50,559
I have you on one side...

1206
01:57:51,600 --> 01:57:53,479
..and on the other side...

1207
01:57:54,480 --> 01:58:02,159
...my grandchild, who left this false
world without taking a single breath.

1208
01:58:14,520 --> 01:58:18,039
The greatest test for mankind
is their children, my daughter.

1209
01:58:24,080 --> 01:58:25,759
My beautiful girl.

1210
01:58:55,200 --> 01:58:58,679
I am taking your revenge, mother.

1211
01:59:13,240 --> 01:59:19,239
Sleep my dear baby

1212
01:59:21,040 --> 01:59:28,079
Sleep well in your dream

1213
01:59:29,840 --> 01:59:37,879
Quietly and stilly

1214
01:59:40,720 --> 01:59:45,119
With angels

1215
01:59:45,120 --> 01:59:47,079
Mother?

1216
01:59:47,080 --> 01:59:55,119
With birds by your side...

1217
01:59:55,200 --> 02:00:02,199
With wind in your hair..

1218
02:00:03,880 --> 02:00:10,879
Quietly and stilly

1219
02:00:13,880 --> 02:00:20,759
Sleep my dear baby

1220
02:00:23,680 --> 02:00:31,719
Sleep my dear baby

1221
02:00:36,040 --> 02:00:39,839
Commander Lukas.

1222
02:00:40,360 --> 02:00:41,879
There is no army outside.

1223
02:00:41,880 --> 02:00:43,799
What do you mean there is no army?

1224
02:00:44,160 --> 02:00:45,279
Osman

1225
02:00:46,000 --> 02:00:47,639
Osman played a game.

1226
02:00:47,640 --> 02:00:49,479
He kept us away from Karesi Bey.

1227
02:00:50,280 --> 02:00:53,119
Damn you, Osman! Damn you

1228
02:00:54,560 --> 02:00:57,639
I thought you would come with all your strength.

1229
02:00:58,040 --> 02:01:04,679
But there are many people I cannot see.

1230
02:01:04,960 --> 02:01:06,279
Right, Karesi Bey?

1231
02:01:06,720 --> 02:01:08,919
Where are the
infidels you allied with?

1232
02:01:10,080 --> 02:01:14,239
You could not deceive my men at the inn.

1233
02:01:14,640 --> 02:01:17,359
And now you are trying again.

1234
02:01:18,320 --> 02:01:24,639
You should know, Osman, you cannot
defeat me with these baseless accusations.

1235
02:01:24,880 --> 02:01:30,119
It's time to swing swords like true men now.

1236
02:01:35,600 --> 02:01:37,759
Like true men, huh?

1237
02:01:39,800 --> 02:01:41,759
Like true men..

1238
02:01:45,080 --> 02:01:46,039
My Bey.

1239
02:02:02,760 --> 02:02:05,359
Orhan, what is the situation?

1240
02:02:05,480 --> 02:02:08,719
I'm coming from Akhisar, the nest of heathens.

1241
02:02:08,720 --> 02:02:14,159
Neither Lukas nor the demon
called Sofia nor any of their soldiers...

1242
02:02:14,800 --> 02:02:18,679
...will be able to get out of that castle.

1243
02:02:24,320 --> 02:02:26,079
Well, Karesi Bey...

1244
02:02:29,600 --> 02:02:31,479
Where are your allies?

1245
02:02:34,760 --> 02:02:36,959
They're all stuck in the castle.

1246
02:02:37,440 --> 02:02:39,879
They can't even take a peek from there.

1247
02:02:49,200 --> 02:02:51,399
You're alone, Karesi Bey.

1248
02:02:52,360 --> 02:02:54,199
You're alone.

1249
02:02:56,360 --> 02:03:00,079
I have no allies expect the
ones standing behind me, Osman.

1250
02:03:00,760 --> 02:03:03,359
I have so many powerful Beys...

1251
02:03:03,600 --> 02:03:06,759
...and so many loyal soldiers with me.

1252
02:03:08,040 --> 02:03:11,759
Who could call such a man alone?

1253
02:03:12,120 --> 02:03:15,959
We can beat you, for sure.

1254
02:03:17,240 --> 02:03:19,479
With a single word of mine,

1255
02:03:20,240 --> 02:03:23,239
...I can leave you all alone here.

1256
02:03:25,880 --> 02:03:27,399
Beys

1257
02:03:48,200 --> 02:03:49,799
What are you doing

1258
02:03:50,080 --> 02:03:51,919
Where are you going?

1259
02:03:52,240 --> 02:03:54,079
Stand behind me!

1260
02:04:00,600 --> 02:04:04,119
Well... All the beys...

1261
02:04:05,560 --> 02:04:10,639
...know what kind of dirty work you are doing.

1262
02:04:20,080 --> 02:04:23,239
Kanyumaz, is what Osman Bey says true?

1263
02:04:23,480 --> 02:04:27,279
Allah is my witness that it's true.

1264
02:04:27,840 --> 02:04:33,119
It's true that he sells steel to heathens
and he's going to fight beside them.

1265
02:04:33,640 --> 02:04:36,758
When you see the heathens
on the battlefield...

1266
02:04:36,770 --> 02:04:39,959
Karesi will say he didn't call them
but they came by themselves.

1267
02:04:45,320 --> 02:04:49,799
Then I won't support Karesi
Bey in this battle, Osman Bey.

1268
02:04:50,760 --> 02:04:53,759
You stopped us from making
a huge mistake, Osman Bey.

1269
02:04:54,040 --> 02:04:56,839
I'm on your side with all
my strength from now on.

1270
02:04:57,160 --> 02:05:00,279
You will keep being on his side.

1271
02:05:01,520 --> 02:05:04,479
You will obey him. In fact,

1272
02:05:05,440 --> 02:05:08,279
...you'll tell him Kanyumaz is a traitor.

1273
02:05:11,320 --> 02:05:15,159
He should come to the
battlefield fully trusting you.

1274
02:05:16,560 --> 02:05:20,919
Kanyumaz will take care of the rest.

1275
02:05:22,080 --> 02:05:27,119
Everybody in this field
knows about your vile actions.

1276
02:05:28,880 --> 02:05:31,119
Karesi Bey.

1277
02:05:33,360 --> 02:05:35,839
Stop lying now.

1278
02:05:37,520 --> 02:05:39,519
Kanyumaz...

1279
02:05:39,960 --> 02:05:44,039
You signed your own death warrant, Kanyumaz.

1280
02:05:47,600 --> 02:05:49,439
Kanyumaz!

1281
02:05:59,160 --> 02:06:01,039
Come here, Kanyumaz!

1282
02:06:12,160 --> 02:06:14,559
Your Bey misses you so much.

1283
02:06:20,720 --> 02:06:24,999
He keeps saying your name all around.

1284
02:06:26,400 --> 02:06:29,319
Right, Karesi...

1285
02:06:31,200 --> 02:06:33,279
...Bey?

1286
02:06:36,520 --> 02:06:40,399
From now on my Bey is you, Osman Bey.

1287
02:06:40,800 --> 02:06:43,639
May Allah give you a long life to rule us.

1288
02:06:52,560 --> 02:06:54,879
Traitor!

1289
02:06:55,080 --> 02:06:57,679
Watch your hands and tongue.

1290
02:07:00,360 --> 02:07:02,319
Or I will cut them off!

1291
02:07:27,080 --> 02:07:28,959
Alps!

1292
02:07:29,400 --> 02:07:34,599
Karesi Bey, who we supported and
with whose orders we rushed to deaths

1293
02:07:34,800 --> 02:07:37,679
...collaborated with those who want our blood

1294
02:07:39,000 --> 02:07:42,599
Now I'm telling you to leave your swords.

1295
02:07:42,960 --> 02:07:45,759
Don't lose your lives in vain

1296
02:08:13,160 --> 02:08:16,079
Did we risk our lives to
collaborate with heathens?

1297
02:08:16,320 --> 02:08:19,119
As Beys don't support you, I won't either.

1298
02:08:19,600 --> 02:08:22,119
Your cause isn't my cause anymore.

1299
02:08:47,640 --> 02:08:49,759
Shame on you.

1300
02:08:50,920 --> 02:08:53,119
Shame on all of you

1301
02:08:54,000 --> 02:08:57,599
I didn't know I fed snakes in my arms!

1302
02:08:58,080 --> 02:08:59,799
No.

1303
02:09:00,520 --> 02:09:03,839
Do you still think you are superior to us?

1304
02:09:07,200 --> 02:09:08,799
Tell me.

1305
02:09:11,400 --> 02:09:13,839
Will you fight me?

1306
02:09:23,280 --> 02:09:29,959
Even if I don't have the
support of Lukas or these traitors,

1307
02:09:30,640 --> 02:09:34,799
...while I have your spy Begum Hatun,

1308
02:09:35,360 --> 02:09:38,399
...I'm the superior one, Osman.

1309
02:09:39,000 --> 02:09:40,999
Alaaddin

1310
02:11:19,880 --> 02:11:22,159
Begum Hatun.

1311
02:11:25,440 --> 02:11:28,279
You saved her as well, huh?

1312
02:11:36,480 --> 02:11:40,359
Whether you fight or not,

1313
02:11:42,800 --> 02:11:44,959
...you and people behind you...

1314
02:11:51,040 --> 02:11:53,879
..have nowhere to go.

1315
02:11:57,160 --> 02:11:59,519
You won, Osman.

1316
02:12:00,560 --> 02:12:05,399
You won this battle without
even swinging a sword.

1317
02:12:06,520 --> 02:12:08,599
I lost.

1318
02:12:09,320 --> 02:12:11,039
You are great...

1319
02:12:13,960 --> 02:12:16,119
...and mighty.